1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:05,900
What if a child is scared of school, not
because of exams,

2
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:10,060
but because of messages on a phone?

3
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:14,520
Today the whole world is talking about
this.

4
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:19,440
Let's decode it the exam way.

5
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:26,670
Today is the International Day against
Violence and Bullying at School,

6
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:32,255
including Cyberbullying, observed on the
first Thursday of November.

7
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:36,130
All 193 member states of the United
Nations Educational,

8
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:41,260
Scientific and Cultural Organization
approved it in 2019,

9
00:00:41,650 --> 00:00:44,470
and it was first observed in 2020.

10
00:00:44,673 --> 00:00:46,113
How big is the problem?

11
00:00:46,233 --> 00:00:52,053
Its report found that one in three
students was bullied at least once in the

12
00:00:52,093 --> 00:00:58,173
past month, and about one in 10 has faced
cyberbullying.

13
00:00:58,963 --> 00:01:02,093
That means one in every three in our
class.

14
00:01:02,163 --> 00:01:06,093
So who protects our children in India?

15
00:01:06,133 --> 00:01:11,043
The National Commission for Protection of
Child Rights,

16
00:01:11,083 --> 00:01:16,243
a statutory body under a 2005 Act, watches
over child rights;

17
00:01:16,283 --> 00:01:21,283
the Protection of Children from Sexual
Offences Act, 2012,

18
00:01:21,403 --> 00:01:25,893
punishes harassment even through digital
means;

19
00:01:26,083 --> 00:01:30,043
and any cybercrime can be reported at
1930.

20
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:35,470
Prelims trap: this day was created by the
United Nations Educational,

21
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:40,960
Scientific and Cultural Organization,
headquartered in Paris,

22
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:47,230
not by the General Assembly; and the Child
Rights Commission is statutory,

23
00:01:47,990 --> 00:01:49,042
not constitutional. Remember these!

24
00:01:49,082 --> 00:01:55,322
Mains and Ethics question: whose duty is
it to stop cyberbullying, the school,

25
00:01:55,362 --> 00:01:58,002
the parents or the platform?

26
00:01:58,042 --> 00:02:05,032
Write your view in the comments, and
follow for one exam trap every day!
